{"product_id":"fox-friend","title":"Fox Friend","description":"\u003cp\u003eClare has lived her whole life on a f arm, but she's never seen a fox...until she finds a tiny, injured cub who's lost his mum. Clare cares for him herself, but has to keep him hidden from her father, who thinks foxes are vermin. Can she keep the cub safe? Beautifully crafted story from a multi award-winning and bestselling author, now with stunning cover artwork by Catherine Rayner. Particularly suitable for struggling, reluctant and dyslexic readers aged 9+\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Morpurgo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781781127506\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 64\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834336370841,"sku":"17RD-39781781127506","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff6ed2906f9_Fox_Friend_Michael_Morpurgo.jpg?v=1761588255","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/fox-friend","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}